video_specification.visual_style:
Background: {BACKGROUND_COLOR or #0F1419}
Accent: {ACCENT_COLOR or #CC785C}

Visual vocabulary: {WHAT_KIND_OF_IMAGERY}
  e.g. "side-view mechanical diagrams with rounded edges"
  e.g. "stacked bar charts with values counting up"
  e.g. "geometric particles forming and dispersing"

Motion vocabulary: {HOW_THINGS_MOVE}
  e.g. "spring physics on entrances, slow Ken Burns drifts on holds"
  e.g. "linear interpolations with sharp wipes between shots"

Forbidden: any sentence from the narration rendered as on-screen
text. Static frames. Lower-third subtitles.
